{"v":4,"catch":"消滅敵人並滲透到基地！","desc":"“STINGER”是SEIBU KAIHATSU於 1983 年發佈的射擊遊戲。\n控制“STINGER WOLF”，前往邪惡生命漫遊的敵人基地中心。\n在緊急情況下，您可以調用友方機器人“BONGO”自動摧毀敵人。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-07-24","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ed0a8550bc83bb23b05d5fbab8244fc4bd6c55c621f89c96beea7de040433d5f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f14e400953497b9474ab2d943f31827641317dcc8e4858bde2c817d7866a88ac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/24456f05d779b1e7d8c134c988f2b7cdbac12fc19a114ecb869f1de2043712f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6add7508e2f4df3394dc87793e200e8e636ac60df40e0a211ce1bbdbf41a85f0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/984b1558deed2978bc5378528249dd6fdeceb0c683e0061a88c4f3cef6209d42.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f5e46f39e784a907da543f5cfbb2ea8aeb560a5c781cc6daf8aeba53b062d761.jpg"],"titleId":"010056b02308e000","dlc":[]}